    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Co-Prompt to Play Bitmagic Live with Friends</h2><br>Bitmagic brings 3D game creation through Steam to everyone. Users prompt in the chat to modify game worlds, gameplay features, and non-player characters, e.g. change the weather, create flying vehicles, design buildings, animals, statues etc. Anything is possible!<br><br>Bitmagic generates game concepts, develops background stories, and creates an immersive 3D worlds. The platform supports multiplayer co-prompting, allowing for instant fun gameplay with friends. Hugging and flying are under development.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178290/extras/5c923ae39bda8c0cf594016f9206c09e.poster.avif?t=1737963878\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178290/extras/5c923ae39bda8c0cf594016f9206c09e.webm?t=1737963878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178290/extras/5c923ae39bda8c0cf594016f9206c09e.mp4?t=1737963878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Co-Prompt to Play Bitmagic Live with Friends</h2><br>Bitmagic brings 3D game creation through Steam to everyone. Users prompt in the chat to modify game worlds, gameplay features, and non-player characters, e.g. change the weather, create flying vehicles, design buildings, animals, statues etc. Anything is possible!<br><br>Bitmagic generates game concepts, develops background stories, and creates an immersive 3D worlds. The platform supports multiplayer co-prompting, allowing for instant fun gameplay with friends. Hugging and flying are under development.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178290/extras/5c923ae39bda8c0cf594016f9206c09e.poster.avif?t=1737963878\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178290/extras/5c923ae39bda8c0cf594016f9206c09e.webm?t=1737963878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178290/extras/5c923ae39bda8c0cf594016f9206c09e.mp4?t=1737963878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
